# For Neon (or any PgBouncer-fronted Postgres), keep pgbouncer=true&connection_limit=1 —
# it tells Prisma it's talking through a pooler (disables incompatible prepared-statement
# caching) and caps Prisma's own pool small so it doesn't exhaust the pooler's connection slots.
